# Research artifacts (capture scripts, HAR files, screenshots, raw probes).
# These live in-tree for convenience but aren't part of the published code.
# Tracked test fixtures live in tests/fixtures/ instead.
# Exception: the help-docs extractor is the canonical regen tool for
# docs/memories/matrix_help_docs.md, so it ships with the project. Use
# `research/*` not `research/` so git can still see inside the dir.
research/*
!research/extract_help_docs.py
!research/capture_matrix_spa.py

# Claude Code per-session agent state. Project-shared `.claude/settings.json`
# and `.claude/skills/` ARE checked in; per-machine override stays local.
.claude/settings.local.json
